{
  "source": "Zotero Web API v3, a sandbox personal library read with a read-only key. The account's user ID, username and object keys are replaced, collection membership is removed, one attachment URL is replaced with an example.org URL, and the reader's own data is replaced with invented values: the annotation comment, the note text, the tags the reader made, the Mendeley tags, the attachment file name, title and hash, and every timestamp. The other strings are bibliographic data of the published works.",
